Package: libdtkwebkit0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WPE WebKit Qt6 embedding layer
 Shared library providing a Qt6 embedding layer for WPE WebKit,
 enabling Qt applications to render web content via WPEBackend-FDO EGL
 without Qt WebEngine or GTK dependencies.

